#only("1")[
#voiceover("One key strategy to mitigate biases in Behavioral Finance is education. By learning about common biases and how they affect financial decisions, individuals can be better prepared to recognize and overcome them.")
]
#only("2")[
#voiceover("Another important strategy is awareness. Being mindful of one's own potential biases and actively seeking to identify them in real-world situations can help reduce their impact on financial choices.")
]
#only("3")[
#voiceover("Finally, using structured decision-making frameworks can help mitigate biases by providing a systematic approach to analyzing information and making choices. These frameworks can help ensure that all relevant factors are considered and that decisions are based on objective criteria rather than subjective biases.")
]
]

#slide()[
